&lt;li&gt;Deep declarative Salesforce skills across Flows, validation rules, permission sets, and page layouts, with a track record of building automation without code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning data quality end to end, including dedupe, validation, and hygiene processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer-service instincts and clear communication with users who are not technical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and a habit of documenting configuration changes so they stay maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to run multiple support requests and project work in parallel, and open to picking up admin work on other GTM tools as the stack requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Administrator or Advanced Administrator certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with change management and release processes, including sandboxes and deployment tools like Gearset or Copado.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on admin experience with Gong, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Apollo.io&quot;&gt;Apollo.io&lt;/a&gt;, or similar GTM tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, financial services, or another highly regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
