&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Mid-Market Account Manager, you&#39;ll join Alloy&#39;s Client Success organization, helping a broad portfolio of mid-market customers maximize the value they receive from the Alloy platform. Working cross-functionally with Sales, Product, Support, and our technical teams, you&#39;ll play a key role in driving customer retention, growth, and long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy operates in a hybrid-work environment. We look to foster collaboration and community by having our local employees onsite three days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Manager, you&#39;ll own a high-volume portfolio of mid-market customers to help them maximize value from the Alloy platform. You&#39;ll serve as the primary commercial point of contact, driving adoption, retention, renewals, and long-term growth through scalable customer engagement and repeatable success programs. Success in this role requires a customer-first, commercially minded approach, sound judgment in prioritizing competing customer needs, deep product expertise, and the ability to execute repeatable customer success motions that drive consistent outcomes across a large portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage a large portfolio of mid-market customer accounts, maintaining a strong understanding of customer goals, account health, product adoption, and renewal timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize customer engagement based on account health, lifecycle stage, product usage, commercial opportunity, and business impact to maximize customer outcomes across your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute repeatable account management plays and scalable customer engagement programs rather than bespoke account plans, ensuring customers receive the right guidance at the right stage of their journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product adoption by delivering customer education, sharing best practices, promoting new features, and connecting customers with Alloy&#39;s self-service resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customers to help them realize ongoing value from the Alloy platform throughout their lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial renewal process, proactively managing renewal readiness and mitigating retention risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor customer health and usage trends to identify risks, proactively re-engage customers, and improve retention outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand customer value through additional products and platform capabilities, partnering with Sales on commercial opportunities where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Technical and Product teams to ensure customers receive the resources and support they need for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with customer stakeholders while serving as their primary commercial advocate within Alloy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface customer feedback and market insights that help improve the customer experience and influence future product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in SaaS Account Management, Customer Success, or a related customer-facing commercial role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing customer renewals, retention, and account growth within a portfolio environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship management, communication, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities across a high-volume book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to interpret customer usage data and identify opportunities or risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, financial services, fraud prevention, identity, compliance, or another regulated industry is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, customer-first approach with a passion for helping customers achieve measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, adaptable, and comfortable working in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
