&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5+ years in Revenue Operations, Sales Operations, or a comparable analytical GTM role, including direct work with field sales leaders on forecasting and territory planning. SaaS experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Salesforce experience across reports, dashboards, and basic configuration. Admin certification is a plus, not a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of operating as an advisor to sales leaders rather than an order-taker, including the judgment to challenge a number the data does not support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel and Sheets skills, and real comfort digging into data to find and explain a trend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp attention to detail, with a habit of catching data problems before anyone downstream does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, direct communication that lands with field reps and non-technical stakeholders alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
